#
# Changes in v1.1.0:
# - Added auto_https off for manual TLS mode to fix TLS handshake errors
# - Changed HTTP redirect to use port-based binding instead of domain-based
#
# Changes in v1.0.0:
# - Initial reverse-proxy routing: / -> fe, /api -> be, HTTP->HTTPS redirect
#

